// ---------------------------------------------------------------
// The front page (newsroom.scene.dry) and the chronicle of decisions
// (recorded by game.js, shown in the Library).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------
// ---------------------------------------------------------------
// The House of Lords, approximately: official figures by party begin
// only in 1984-85. About 1,170 members, some 300 of them hereditary
// peers who take no whip and rarely attend. The SDP takes peers from
